"P343930515" "Alliance in the Works"
// DetailString :
"P3717427591" "The Resistance had freed the experiments in an effort to recruit them to their cause. If you hadn't stopped them when you did then who knows what sort of havoc they could have done together."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P4277163465" "That fool Neuron has been careless once more. And again, the great Doctor Hetzfeld will clean up the mess. Only this time, Neuron's failure will be my success!<br><br>I'm on my way to the top, {HeroName}, won't you join me?"
// AcceptString :
"P2865047185" "Accept"
// SendOffString :
"P447651177" "Splendid! One of Neuron's cloning labs was recently attacked by a terrorist cell. They got more than the bargained for, however, as their explosives did more than breach the facility, it also released a number of the murderous experiments contained within. I want you to clean up Neuron's mess, but make sure that they are not returned to his lab, but rather, mine."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P1650100859" "Round up Failed Experiments"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P3612115817" "You need to get that thing taken care off we talked about earlier."

