// Clue Name :
"P3486639985" "Bombs"
// DetailString :
"P1853660861" "Seems like these citizens have a mission; urban renewal."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P365163290" "Hauptman Industries has been acquired by AntiMatter, and the workers laid off. I have reason to support AntiMatter's position on this, if only because Neuron was using the facilities to conduct ill-advised genetic experimentation. I would like you to make the transition for AntiMatter as smooth as possible, and drive the squatters off the property."
// SendOffString :
"P1493154116" "You may wonder why I would think an individual of your capabilities would be needed for such a change of guards. Well, the truth is, anything could spark off the enmity shared between those two, ever since Neuron was granted AntiMatter's Praetorship, the two have been all but fighting in the streets with one another. I want you to make sure things don't get out of hand."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P1462959550" "Kick squatters out of Hauptman Industries"

